<title>FRANCE: Lafarge buys back 2.2 pct of own capital.</title>
<headline>Lafarge buys back 2.2 pct of own capital.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom sold 2.2 percent of the capital of building materials group Lafarge to Lafarge for a price of 312 francs a share, a source at the building materials group said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Lafarge paid about 660 million francs for the purchase of its own shares, said the source.</p>
<p>Daily La Tribune said Lafarge now held a little less than five percent of its own capital.</p>
</text>
